\u00b2 +h\u00b2 )^2 / h\u00b2 = [ (k\u00b2 +h\u00b2 )^2 (h\u00b2 -k\u00b2 )^2 ] / [ h\u00b2 (h\u00b2 -k\u00b2 )^2 ]\n\nTherefore, EF^2 = [4 h^4 k\u00b2 (h\u00b2 +k\u00b2 ) + (k\u00b2 +h\u00b2 )^2 (h\u00b2 -k\u00b2 )^2 ] / [ h\u00b2 (h\u00b2 -k\u00b2 )^2 ]\n\nFactor out (k\u00b2 +h\u00b2 ):\n\n= (k\u00b2 +h\u00b2 ) [4 h^4 k\u00b2 + (k\u00b2 +h\u00b2 )(h\u00b2 -k\u00b2 )^2 ] / [ h\u00b2 (h\u00b2 -k\u00b2 )^2 ]\n\nNow compute the numerator inside:\n\n4 h^4 k\u00b2 + (k\u00b2 +h\u00b2 )(h\u00b2 -k\u00b2 )^2\n\nExpand (h\u00b2 -k\u00b2 )^2 = h^4 -2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2 +k^4\n\nMultiply by (k\u00b2 +h\u00b2 ):\n\n= (k\u00b2 +h\u00b2 )(h^4 -2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2 +k^4 )\n\n= k\u00b2 (h^4 -2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2 +k^4 ) + h\u00b2 (h^4 -2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2 +k^4 )\n\n= k\u00b2 h^4 -2 k^4 h\u00b2 +k^6 +h^6 -2 h^4 k\u00b2 +h\u00b2 k^4\n\nCombine like terms:\n\nh^6 + (k\u00b2 h^4 -2 h^4 k\u00b2 ) + (-2 k^4 h\u00b2 +h\u00b2 k^4 ) +k^6\n\n= h^6 - h^4 k\u00b2 - h\u00b2 k^4 +k^6\n\nThus, numerator inside becomes:\n\n4 h^4 k\u00b2 + h^6 - h^4 k\u00b2 - h\u00b2 k^4 +k^6 = h^6 +3 h^4 k\u00b2 - h\u00b2 k^4 +k^6\n\nTherefore, EF^2= (k\u00b2 +h\u00b2 )(h^6 +3 h^4 k\u00b2 - h\u00b2 k^4 +k^6 ) / [ h\u00b2 (h\u00b2 -k\u00b2 )^2 ]\n\nNow, compute ED^2:\n\nEarlier, I had:\n\nED^2 = [4 k^6 h\u00b2 + (h^4 + 2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2 -k^4 )^2 ] / [ h\u00b2 (h\u00b2 -k\u00b2 )^2 ]\n\nExpand (h^4 +2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2 -k^4 )^2:\n\n= h^8 +4 h^6 k\u00b2 +4 h^4 k^4 -2 h^4 k^4 +k^8 -4 h\u00b2 k^6\n\nWait, wait, more carefully:\n\n(h^4 +2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2 -k^4 )^2 = h^4^2 + (2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2 )^2 + (-k^4 )^2 + 2*h^4*2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2 + 2*h^4*(-k^4 ) + 2*2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2*(-k^4 )\n\n= h^8 +4 h^4 k^4 +k^8 +4 h^6 k\u00b2 -2 h^8 k^4 -4 h^6 k^6\n\nWait, no, let's do it step by step:\n\n(a + b + c)^2 = a^2 + b^2 + c^2 + 2ab + 2ac + 2bc\n\nBut here, it's (h^4 +2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2 -k^4 )^2. Let me set a = h^4, b =2 h\u00b2 k\u00b2, c = -k^4.\n\nThen,\n\n= a\u00b2 + b\u00b2 + c\u00b2 + 2ab + 2ac + 2bc\n\n= h^8 +4 h^4 k^4 +k^8 + 2*(h^4)(2 h\u00